%e A396731 The upper zone contains the partitions of 6 and the lower zone contains the divisors of the numbers of the 6th row of the triangle A176206. Note that both zones contain the same numbers but in distinct order.
%e A396731 For k = 3 the sum of the column k=3 of the arrangement is [2+1+1+1+1+1+1] + [3+3+3+3] = 8 + 12 = 20, so T(6,3) = 20.
